bareos-director-rust (0.25.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release — Rust drop-in replacement for Bareos Director
  * 135 unit tests, 8192 parallel connections verified
  * JSON Schema ORM for catalog management
  * TLS-PSK + CRAM-MD5 + gRPC support
  * Compatible with Bareos 25.x FD/SD

